# GitHub issue assignee (PHPStorm / monorepo workspace)

When creating issues with **`gh issue create`** for **any** repository tied to this workspace (including **`excellentingenuity/LegacyTradeCollege`**, **`InEngine/TableUI`**, **`excellentingenuity/ltc-wordpress-plugins`**, or any other repo the user names under this PHPStorm project), **always** include:

```bash
--assignee excellentingenuity
```

unless the user **explicitly** asks for a different assignee or says **not** to assign.

If **`gh issue create`** fails on assignee (permissions, org SSO, or user not in assignable list), report the error and suggest checking org membership or `gh auth refresh` as appropriate.
